          "distinct": true,
          "id": "62d7dc30afb59f4ab15ed7cb299b5ea4af0c8db7",
          "message": "feat: Add emt_initial flag to the EMT reduction (#4556)\n\n* Improved EMT Unittests.\r\n\r\n* Added new emt_initial flag which allows one to change the distance function used to initialize the scorer. Improved the scorer update logic. Added new unit tests for new functionality.\r\n\r\n* Improved the runtime performance of EMT at the expense of slightly worse code testability and readability.\r\n\r\n* Fixed the clang format.\r\n\r\n* One more unittest and a small bug fix.\r\n\r\n* Fixed clang-format errors.\r\n\r\n* Update eigen_memory_tree.cc\r\n\r\n* Updated the help test file.\r\n\r\n* Fixed clang format error. Improved a comment.\r\n\r\n* Fixed a memory leak in an EMT unittest.\r\n\r\n* Improved default settings to support explicit overrides.\r\n\r\n* Simplified model saving using the .keep() functionality of command line flags. Updated the save load unittests to check that flags are saved.\r\n\r\n* Fixed clang formatting error.\r\n\r\n* Reverted to previous save logic so that we don't break any models already saved.",
          "timestamp": "2023-05-11T01:11:49Z",
          "tree_id": "044a3872c8c88d62684c94f4b86bfd7f49ab25e0",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/62d7dc30afb59f4ab15ed7cb299b5ea4af0c8db7"
