          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b207cb888e7b85a9fcd7fc07b89bc28a40197f60",
          "message": "chore: maintenance updates and Windows CI artifacts (#4727)\n\n* chore: remove deprecated LGTM badge from README\n\nLGTM.com has been shut down and merged into GitHub Code Scanning.\nThe badge is no longer functional.\n\nThis supersedes PR #4705.\n\n* chore: use SPDX license identifier in Java POM\n\nChange license name from 'Vowpal Wabbit License' to standardized\nSPDX identifier 'BSD-3-Clause' for better clarity and standardization.\n\nIncorporates PR #4708.\n\n* Add Windows artifact packaging to vcpkg_build workflow\n\n- Package vw.exe and required DLLs after successful build+test\n- Only runs on Windows builds (runner.os == 'Windows')\n- Smart retention: 7 days for PRs, 90 days for master/releases\n- Artifacts named: vw-{os}-{preset}-{sha}\n\n* Fix Windows artifact packaging\n\n- Correct executable path: vw.exe (not vw_cli_bin.exe)\n- Only package Release builds, not Debug\n- Simplified artifact name (removed preset suffix)\n\n* Test packaged Windows artifact with run_tests.py before upload\n\nRun the full test suite against the packaged artifact to verify:\n- All required DLLs are included\n- The artifact is self-contained and functional\n- No packaging issues before upload\n\nUses the same test approach as vendor_build.yml workflow.\n\n* Test packaged artifacts with --help tests skipped\n\nSkip tests 275 and 276 (--help output tests) when testing the packaged\nartifact. These tests are sensitive to compile-time features.\n\nThe vcpkg build includes CSV and FlatBuffer features for better user\nexperience, but test references were generated without these features.\nThe --help output differences are expected and benign.\n\nAll other tests run normally to verify artifact functionality.\n\n* fix: increase valgrind test timeout to 150 seconds\n\nTests 426 and 428 (automl model loading with invert_hash) were timing\nout with the default 100-second timeout. Increase to 150 seconds to\naccommodate valgrind's performance overhead.",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-14T10:31:03-05:00",
          "tree_id": "b314ff877fba13816ffc683d13ef4575e9d98ca7",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/b207cb888e7b85a9fcd7fc07b89bc28a40197f60"
