          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d13ab70bd67374c077614c60662c729e2a70155c",
          "message": "fix: update Eigen JacobiSVD to use template parameter for compute options (#4731)\n\n* fix: update Eigen JacobiSVD to avoid deprecated compute() with options\n\nUpdates Eigen JacobiSVD usage to construct the SVD object with the matrix\nand compute options together, avoiding the deprecated compute() method\nthat takes options as a runtime parameter.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed _svd member variable from one_pass_svd_impl class\n- Construct JacobiSVD locally in run() with matrix and options:\n  Eigen::JacobiSVD<Eigen::MatrixXf> svd(AOmega, Eigen::ComputeThinU | Eigen::ComputeThinV)\n- This uses the constructor overload instead of the deprecated compute() method\n\nThis resolves the deprecation warning:\n'compute' is deprecated: Options should be specified using the class\ntemplate parameter.\n\nThe constructor-based approach is the recommended way in Eigen 5.x\nand avoids the deprecation while maintaining identical functionality.\n\nFixes warnings in: vcpkg_build, asan, build_macos workflows\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update vcpkg submodule for eigen3 5.0.1 version database entry\n\nUpdates vcpkg to include version database entries for eigen3 5.0.1\nand boost-math 1.90.0, which are required by the updated dependencies.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
