          "id": "6a23830ebac1440a6fa1008fbc2c15d6188cc308",
          "message": "fix: replace deprecated codecvt with manual UTF-16 to UTF-8 conversion (#4744)\n\nReplace the deprecated std::wstring_convert and std::codecvt_utf8_utf16\nwith a manual UTF-16 to UTF-8 conversion implementation. This resolves\nC++17 deprecation warnings on macOS and Windows.\n\nThe new implementation:\n- Handles 1-4 byte UTF-8 sequences correctly\n- Properly processes surrogate pairs for codepoints > U+FFFF\n- Is provided as an inline function in vwdll_internal.h for testing\n\nTests use explicit codepoint values instead of string literals to avoid\nsource file encoding issues on Windows MSVC.\n\nFixes deprecation warnings:\n- 'codecvt_utf8_utf16<char16_t>' is deprecated\n- 'wstring_convert<std::codecvt_utf8_utf16<char16_t>, char16_t>' is deprecated\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
