          "id": "9b7e6926285320ef4bf068537b974defa2ddc255",
          "message": "fix: use VW namespace for features iterator to avoid deprecation warning (#4745)\n\nChange `features::const_iterator` to `VW::features::const_iterator`\nto match the declaration in vw_to_flat.h and avoid deprecation warning:\n\n  'features' is deprecated: Moved into VW namespace. Will be removed in VW 10.\n\nThe features class was moved into the VW namespace and the global\n`features` typedef is deprecated.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
