          "id": "c8ed5305a056c2e8cd930436031284cfeb4983aa",
          "message": "ci: upgrade actions/checkout from v3 to v4 (#4746)\n\nUpgrades all GitHub Actions checkout steps from v3 to v4 to improve\nreliability of submodule cloning. Version 4 includes:\n- Better retry logic for transient network failures\n- Improved error handling for git operations\n- More robust submodule initialization\n\nThis should reduce instances of \"Could not resolve host: github.com\"\nerrors that occasionally occur during CI runs.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
