          "distinct": true,
          "id": "60a9fa255e04d086a6310a62ebb19b0282cacf02",
          "message": "fix: suppress MSVC warnings for reserved macros and deprecations in benchmarks (#4748)\n\nSuppresses multiple MSVC warnings:\n\n1. C4661 warnings for automl template instantiations in both automl_impl.cc\n   and automl_iomodel.cc (template methods split across translation units)\n\n2. C4117 warnings for modifying reserved macro _M_CEE in object_pool.h and\n   allreduce.h (intentional workaround for managed C++ limitations)\n\n3. Deprecation warnings in benchmark files for io_buf, example, and multi_ex\n   types that have been moved into VW namespace\n\nWhat is _M_CEE?\n_M_CEE is a Microsoft compiler predefined macro set when compiling with /clr\n(managed C++). The code undefines/redefines it to work around the limitation\nthat <mutex> and <condition_variable> cannot be used in managed C++ contexts.\n\nChanges:\n- Added pragma warning suppression for C4661 in automl files\n- Added pragma warning suppression for C4117 inside #ifdef _M_CEE blocks\n  (right before undef/define to ensure it's active during preprocessing)\n- Changed io_buf -> VW::io_buf in benchmark_funcs.cc\n- Changed example* -> VW::example* in benchmark_funcs.cc and rcv1_benchmarks.cc\n- Changed multi_ex -> VW::multi_ex in benchmark_text_input.cc",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-14T22:57:48-05:00",
          "tree_id": "6f0e9d719a4967af172a19a4bc58f74f3a918199",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/60a9fa255e04d086a6310a62ebb19b0282cacf02"
