          "id": "341afc4ba7f36dbbaec2340e13331676e85b996f",
          "message": "fix: upgrade .NET target framework from netcoreapp3.1 to net8.0 (#4750)\n\nUpdates .NET console applications from netcoreapp3.1 (out of support since\nDecember 2022) to net8.0 (LTS, supported until November 2026).\n\nThis eliminates the .NET build warnings:\n  'The target framework 'netcoreapp3.1' is out of support and will not\n  receive security updates in the future.'\n\n.NET 8.0 is the latest LTS release and provides:\n- Security updates through November 2026\n- Performance improvements\n- Modern C# language features\n- Better compatibility with current tooling\n\nFiles updated:\n- cs/cs_console/netcoreapp/vw.console.csproj\n- cs/examples/simulator/netcoreapp/vw.simulator.csproj",
