          "id": "b8e7be620b15e4d9e26d7b6cd71511685e80b291",
          "message": "fix: upgrade docker/setup-qemu-action from v1 to v3 (#4751)\n\nUpgrades docker/setup-qemu-action from v1 to v3 to eliminate the\ndeprecated set-output command warning.\n\nThe v1 action uses the deprecated GitHub Actions command:\n  echo \"::set-output name=foo::bar\"\n\nThis syntax is deprecated and will be disabled. The v3 action uses\nthe modern environment file syntax:\n  echo \"foo=bar\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n\nWarning eliminated:\n  'The `set-output` command is deprecated and will be disabled soon.\n  Please upgrade to using Environment Files.'\n\nChanges:\n- docker/setup-qemu-action@v1 → docker/setup-qemu-action@v3 (2 instances)\n\nThe v3 action is compatible with the existing workflow and adds:\n- Support for multi-platform builds\n- Better caching\n- Uses modern GitHub Actions syntax",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-15T12:18:17-05:00",
