          "id": "fca38eebe3bcf0ee37ae74dc6111dd7b11886bc4",
          "message": "fix: add explicit casts to suppress MSVC C4244/C4267 conversion warnings (#4753)\n\nAdd static_cast to prevent implicit narrowing conversions that trigger MSVC warnings:\n\n1. cb_explore_adf_large_action_space.cc: Cast float seed to uint64_t\n2. hashstring.h: Cast size_t to uint32_t in hashstring return\n3. action_score.h: Cast ptrdiff_t to difference_type in iterator subtraction\n4. vw.h: Cast uint64_t namespace hash to uint32_t for hash_func_t calls\n\nThese casts make the intentional narrowing explicit and suppress warnings\nwhile preserving existing behavior.",
