          "id": "e329a2891ce74d6ae52de4053eb0956cc6f4a412",
          "message": "fix: eliminate remaining MSVC compiler warnings (62,660 warnings total) (#4758)\n\nThis combines fixes for three categories of MSVC warnings:\n\n1. C4996 STL4043 - Deprecation warnings (62,640 warnings)\n   - MSVC 2022 deprecated stdext::checked_array_iterator in favor of C++20's std::span\n   - Added _SILENCE_STDEXT_ARR_ITERS_DEPRECATION_WARNING for MSVC 2022+ builds\n   - File: CMakeLists.txt\n\n2. C4353 - Nonstandard extension warning (2 warnings)\n   - MSVC warns about using constant 0 as function expression\n   - Added pragma to suppress warning around lambda definition\n   - File: vowpalwabbit/core/include/vw/core/interactions_predict.h\n\n3. C4267 - size_t conversion warnings (18 warnings)\n   - std::iota called with int literal but container holds larger types\n   - Changed to use properly typed initial values (size_t{0}, uint64_t{0})\n   - Files: vowpalwabbit/core/src/feature_group.cc,\n           vowpalwabbit/core/src/reductions/epsilon_decay.cc\n\nCombined with the previously merged PR #4757 (C4244 warnings), this eliminates\nall 62,796 compiler warnings from MSVC builds.",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-16T09:35:34-05:00",
