          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2e171a673ac1d9113076c75ae496d037d98aebee",
          "message": "fix: add explicit cast in get_stride to eliminate C4244 warning (#4759)\n\nThe get_stride() function returns uint32_t but all.weights.stride() returns\nuint64_t, causing implicit conversion warnings when external consumers compile\nagainst the public API headers (e.g., in NuGet test projects).\n\nAdded static_cast<uint32_t> to make the conversion explicit and intentional,\nmatching the pattern used in num_weights() on line 339.\n\nThis eliminates the remaining 8 C4244 warnings that appear in NuGet tests:\n- 4 warnings in v141 (VS 2017) tests\n- 4 warnings in v142 (VS 2019) tests\n\nFile: vowpalwabbit/core/include/vw/core/vw.h:341",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-16T11:00:13-05:00",
          "tree_id": "a711cee1f0d8741dad5593ba22ea88982701cdff",
