          "message": "ci: add retry logic to ASAN workflow for transient network failures (#4781)\n\nReplace lukka/run-cmake action with a bash script that retries\ncmake configure up to 3 times with 30-second delays. This handles\ntransient network failures during vcpkg dependency downloads\n(e.g., \"Could not resolve host: github.com\").\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
