          "id": "fb8d003d1737d8c0d7fa3c0009a070f4377db7f2",
          "message": "feat(wasm): add TypeScript declarations for npm package (#4784)\n\nAdd comprehensive TypeScript type definitions for the @vowpalwabbit/vowpalwabbit\nnpm package. This enables better IDE support, autocomplete, and type checking\nfor TypeScript users.\n\nChanges:\n- Create wasm/types/index.d.ts with full type declarations for:\n  - Workspace and CbWorkspace classes\n  - WorkspaceOptions, CBExample, CBLabel interfaces\n  - Prediction type enum\n  - VWExampleLogger class (Node.js only)\n  - WasmModule interface\n- Update package.json with \"types\" field pointing to declarations\n- Add types to conditional exports for proper module resolution\n- Include types/**/*.d.ts in published package files\n\nFixes #4697\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
