          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c379168130e093ba016e29c95a9f57b25ec27be4",
          "message": "docs: improve search_rollin and search_rollout help text (#4805)\n\n* docs: improve search_rollin and search_rollout help text\n\nAdd detailed descriptions for the search_rollin and search_rollout\noptions to clarify what each value means:\n- ref/oracle: use actions from the reference (logged or imitation-target) policy\n- policy/learn: use actions from the learned model\n- mix_per_roll/mix: randomly choose policy at the start of each trajectory\n- mix_per_state: randomly choose policy for each action\n\nFixes #3481\n\n* fix: add missing CB graph feedback section to help.stdout\n\nThe reference file was missing the graph feedback options that were\nadded to master after this branch was created.",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-24T07:45:05-05:00",
