          "message": "test: add coverage tests for cbify, lda, log_multi, stagewise_poly, memory_tree, shared_data (#4812)\n\nAdd tests targeting uncovered code paths:\n- cbify.cc: get_squared_loss, get_absolute_loss, get_01_loss via --cbify_reg with --loss_option\n- lda_core.cc: digamma, lgamma, powf switch cases via --math-mode 1 and 2\n- log_multi.cc: save_load_tree via save/load cycle\n- stagewise_poly.cc: sort_data_update_support via --stage_poly training\n- memory_tree.cc: tree building paths via --memory_tree multiclass training\n- shared_data.cc: copy assignment and move construction operators",
