          "id": "58fb12cf61c8fd55890ae46b92e4b5c7bf6b1a5b",
          "message": "test: add unit tests for VW::initialize overloads (#4814)\n\nAdd comprehensive unit tests covering VW::initialize functions:\n\n- VW::initialize with options_cli object\n- VW::initialize with vector of string args\n- VW::initialize with driver output function\n- VW::initialize with model override reader\n- VW::initialize with custom logger\n- VW::initialize_experimental with various parameters\n- VW::seed_vw_model for model seeding with shared weights\n- Error handling tests for invalid and conflicting options\n- Tests for different reduction stacks (cb_explore_adf, csoaa_ldf, oaa)\n\nThese tests improve coverage of the VW initialization code paths\nthat were previously only covered by integration tests.",
