          "id": "053f5a8598bc38c6ea0137f8e8ac2804a2a4de7e",
          "message": "test: add end-to-end tests for BFGS hessian and conjugate gradient (#4813)\n\n* test: add end-to-end tests for BFGS hessian and conjugate gradient\n\nAdd two new end-to-end tests to improve code coverage:\n\n1. BFGS with --hessian_on option: Tests the second derivative calculation\n   path in bfgs_iter_middle for curvature estimation.\n\n2. Conjugate gradient: Tests the --conjugate_gradient optimizer which uses\n   BFGS with m=0 and curvature calculation enabled.\n\nBoth tests use rcv1_small.dat dataset and include reference stderr/stdout\nfiles for regression testing.\n\n* fix: correct cache file paths in BFGS reference files\n\nReference files had incorrect paths (test/train-sets/) that didn't\nmatch the CI test environment which runs from the test directory.\n\n* fix: skip conjugate_gradient tests in model generation\n\nconjugate_gradient is a BFGS variant that also doesn't support\nmodel save/resume, so it needs to be skipped in model generation\nalong with bfgs tests.",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-24T13:41:04-05:00",
