          "distinct": true,
          "id": "71f7828ecd68746701556238559d7d22fefc1745",
          "message": "test: add unit tests for search reduction options (#4815)\n\nAdd 16 unit tests covering previously untested search options:\n\nOptions tested:\n- --search_no_caching: Disable caching\n- --search_xv: Cross-validation mode\n- --search_linear_ordering: Linear order generation\n- --search_perturb_oracle: Perturb oracle on rollin\n- --search_subsample_time: Subsample timesteps (percentage and fixed)\n- --search_metatask debug: Debug metatask\n- --search_rollout_num_steps: Limit rollout steps\n- --search_rollout (policy, learn, none): Different rollout modes\n- --search_rollin (policy, learn): Different rollin modes\n- --search_history_length: History length setting\n\nTasks tested:\n- argmax: Argmax search task\n- Combined options test\n\nThese tests improve coverage of the search reduction code paths\nthat were previously only covered by integration tests.",
