          "id": "581229c52e78c310da00c4202ec0f51a217b48b9",
          "message": "test: add coverage tests for marginal, cs_active, bfgs, cbify, and lda audit (#4817)\n\nAdd 6 new e2e tests (tests 476-481) to improve code coverage:\n\n- Test 476: marginal with update_before_learn and compete options\n  Covers predict_or_learn update_before_learn path in marginal.cc\n\n- Test 477: cs_active with csa_debug option\n  Covers debug output paths in cs_active.cc find_cost_range\n\n- Test 478: BFGS with l2 regularization and no_bias_regularization\n  Covers add_regularization no_bias path in bfgs.cc\n\n- Test 479: cbify regression with loss_option 1 (absolute loss)\n  Covers get_absolute_loss function in cbify.cc\n\n- Test 480: cbify regression with loss_option 2 (0/1 loss)\n  Covers get_01_loss function in cbify.cc\n\n- Test 481: LDA with audit option\n  Covers print_lda_features function in gd.cc",
