          "id": "a798ffa258285d848734238b6d41769782aa8f84",
          "message": "test: add coverage tests for svrg, no_label, baseline, cost_sensitive, and confidence_sequence (#4820)\n\nAdd comprehensive test coverage for low-coverage files:\n\nNew test files:\n- svrg_test.cc: 9 tests for SVRG optimizer (initialization, learn/predict,\n  save/load, multi-pass learning, weighted examples)\n- no_label_test.cc: 9 tests for no-label parser interface\n- cost_sensitive_label_test.cc: 20 tests for CS label parsing and\n  is_cs_example_header()\n- baseline_reduction_test.cc: 16 tests for baseline reduction options\n  (global_only, check_enabled, lr_multiplier, save/load)\n\nExtended existing tests:\n- confidence_sequence_test.cc: 13 new tests for incremental_f_sum,\n  update with dropout, reset_stats, model serialization\n- continuous_actions_parser_test.cc: 15 new tests for is_test_label,\n  is_labeled, to_string, cache/read cached label",
