          "distinct": true,
          "id": "8ac53f99a595e93213a2a184912a3e747c488778",
          "message": "test: add coverage tests for learner, shared_data, cb, and multiclass (#4821)\n\n* test: add coverage tests for learner, shared_data, cb, and multiclass\n\nAdd unit tests and E2E tests to increase code coverage targeting:\n- learner.cc: require_singleline/multiline, get_learner_by_name_prefix,\n  learner properties, save/load operations\n- shared_data.cc: copy/move constructors, update(), print_summary()\n- cb.cc: label parsing, get_observed_cost_cb, header detection,\n  model serialization\n- multiclass.cc: label parsing, is_labeled, model serialization\n\nUnit tests (3 new files, 110 tests):\n- vowpalwabbit/core/tests/learner_test.cc (30 tests)\n- vowpalwabbit/core/tests/shared_data_test.cc (33 tests)\n- vowpalwabbit/core/tests/cb_labels_test.cc (47 tests)\n\nE2E tests (24 new tests, IDs 487-510):\n- Kernel SVM: rbf/poly kernels with custom parameters, save/load\n- cs_active: min/max labels, domination, cost_max variations\n- parse_regressor: initial_weight, random/normal/truncated_normal_weights,\n  readable_model, invert_hash\n\n* fix: rename initial_weight test files to avoid conflict with test 149\n\nTest 149 already uses initial_weight.stderr and initial_weight.stdout.\nRename test 497's reference files to initial_weight_05.* to avoid conflict.\n\n* fix: restore original initial_weight reference files from master\n\n* test: remove cs_active E2E tests due to platform-dependent NaN output\n\nThe cs_active tests produce NaN values which have platform-dependent\nstring representations (-nan vs nan), causing CI failures.\n\n* test: renumber test IDs to close gaps after removing cs_active tests\n\nThe test framework requires continuous test IDs without gaps.\n\n* fix: restore original cs_active reference files from master\n\nAccidentally deleted reference files needed by existing tests 164, 165, 477.\n\n* test: reduce test dataset size from 250/1000 to 25 examples\n\n- Create smaller test datasets (rcv1_25.dat, 0002_25.dat) with 25 examples\n- Update E2E tests to use smaller datasets\n- Regenerate all reference files with reduced output\n\n* test: remove orphaned initial_weight.predict file (not used by any test)",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-25T23:54:38-05:00",
