          "distinct": true,
          "id": "859eed7750cdf72c5b5b23373b956b18c8d3ac5c",
          "message": "test: add edge case tests for cb_labels, learner, and shared_data (#4822)\n\n* test: add edge case tests for cb_labels, learner, and shared_data\n\nAdd targeted tests for edge cases and error handling paths:\n\ncb_labels_test.cc:\n- Probability clamping (>1 and <0)\n- Shared feature handling without cost\n- FLT_MAX cost, zero cost, negative cost\n- Zero and exact 1.0 probability\n- Multiclass trailing character and too many words errors\n- Multiclass label with weight\n\nlearner_test.cc:\n- Singleline/multiline learner type checking\n- Learner by name prefix navigation\n- Base learner stack traversal\n- Feature width for OAA\n- Save/load operations\n- Prediction and label type getters\n- Multiple passes and empty examples\n\nshared_data_test.cc:\n- Update dump interval (additive and multiplicative)\n- Print update with various label types\n- Print summary with holdout, passes, queries\n- Holdout counters and tracking\n- Label observation tracking\n\n* fix: remove tests that cause memory leaks under ASAN/valgrind\n\nRemove TrailingCharacterThrows and TooManyWordsThrows tests that\ncause memory leaks when exceptions are thrown during read_example().\n\nThese cases are already tested in multiclass_label_parser_test.cc\nusing the lower-level parse_label API which doesn't leak.\n\n* refactor: remove redundant tests, keep unique edge cases\n\nRemove tests that were duplicates or just tested C++ struct assignment.\nKeep 7 unique tests that add coverage value:\n\ncb_labels_test.cc (kept):\n- ProbabilityClampingAboveOne - tests probability > 1.0 clamping\n- ProbabilityClampingBelowZero - tests probability < 0.0 clamping\n- SharedWithoutCost - tests shared feature marker\n- MultipleActions - tests parsing multiple actions\n- NegativeCost - tests negative cost (reward) parsing\n\nmulticlass (kept):\n- LabelWithWeight - tests label with explicit weight\n- UnlabeledExample - tests unlabeled prediction\n\nRemoved redundant tests:\n- learner_test.cc: All LearnerEdgeCases (duplicated existing tests)\n- shared_data_test.cc: All SharedDataEdgeCases (just struct assignment)\n- cb_labels_test.cc: FLTMaxCost, ActionOnlyCost, ZeroCost,\n  ZeroProbability, ExactlyOneProbability (duplicates or trivial)",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-26T09:59:28-05:00",
