          "id": "d4eae7d36953fc988029f0dd59120b1e229db48c",
          "message": "fix: resolve CI workflow failures for Build Documentation and .NET Nugets (#4826)\n\nBuild Documentation:\n- Fix checkout path from 'vowpal_wabbit/docs' to 'docs'\n- The previous path created a docs repo at a different location than\n  where subsequent commands expected it, causing git commands to fail\n  with \"not a git repository\"\n\n.NET Nugets (benchmark_nuget):\n- Add extensive debug output to identify root cause of \"Cannot read\n  properties of null (reading 'Mean')\" error\n- Add filter to exclude benchmarks with null Statistics (some entries\n  may have null Statistics if they were skipped or didn't execute)\n- The jq filter now properly handles edge cases where DisplayInfo\n  might not contain expected values",
