          "id": "3be7ea60b211d19eb8d4b26fce6097773d1737ec",
          "message": "fix: use both nuget.org and local sources for .NET package restore (#4828)\n\nThe NuGet restore was failing because using --source with only the local\ndownloaded_nugets folder excluded nuget.org, preventing BenchmarkDotNet\nand other dependencies from being found.\n\nChanges:\n- Combine restore into single command with both sources\n- Remove set +e / exit 0 workaround since errors should now fail properly\n- Apply fix to all three jobs: test_nuget_dotnetcore,\n  test_nuget_dotnetframework, and benchmark_nuget",
