          "distinct": true,
          "id": "783639a807d917d7de4d2ea024f896e76a8dcaaf",
          "message": "fix: upgrade .NET benchmark from net6.0 to net8.0 (#4829)\n\n.NET 6.0 is end-of-life and causing benchmark failures on GitHub Actions\nrunners with \"app-launch-failed\" errors. BenchmarkDotNet spawns child\nprocesses to run benchmarks, and the .NET 6.0 runtime is not working\ncorrectly on current runners.\n\nChanges:\n- Upgrade target framework from net6.0 to net8.0\n- Upgrade BenchmarkDotNet from 0.13.1 to 0.14.0 (required for .NET 8 support)\n- Update benchmark config to use CoreRuntime.Core80\n- Update workflow to build/run with --framework net8.0",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-27T20:07:43-05:00",
