          "id": "330b130d10fb30e67dd493507711e51d8131207f",
          "message": "test: remove 26 redundant tests with identical coverage (#4830)\n\nRemove 24 GTests and 2 regression tests that have mutual coverage\noverlap (each pair covers identical code lines). The remaining tests\nin each pair provide equivalent coverage.\n\nRemoved GTests:\n- Boosting.BBMLearnAndPredict (covered by ManyWeakLearners)\n- Cats.GetLossWithDefaultBandwidth (covered by GetLossFor)\n- CatsTree.OtcAlgoLearn2ActionNotSiblings/Separate (covered by others)\n- Las.CheckSpannerResultsSquarecb (covered by Cubcb)\n- 10 ExpectileLoss tests (covered by ParameterEqualsZeroTest)\n- ModelUtil.UniquePtrString/VectorUniquePtrString (covered by simpler tests)\n- OptionsCli.IncorrectOptionTypeStrForInt/NonmatchingValues (covered by others)\n- 5 Search tests (covered by remaining search tests)\n\nRemoved regression tests (IDs renumbered to maintain contiguity):\n- Original test 56 (covered by test 55)\n- Original test 59 (covered by test 58)",
