          "id": "0cbcac21549101947b83e4408ae506853b366d87",
          "message": "docs: improve option help text for several reductions (#4847)\n\n* docs: improve option help text for several reductions\n\nExpand terse help strings to be more descriptive for users:\n- cb_type: explain abbreviations (ips, dm, dr, mtr, sm)\n- memory_tree alpha: describe as smoothing parameter\n- memory_tree online: distinguish from dream_at_update\n- bs_type: clarify bootstrap aggregation context\n- ksvm/kernel: capitalize properly, list kernel types\n- active_cover: describe cover set meaning\n- bfgs mem: explain L-BFGS stored corrections\n- lda metrics: specify coherence metrics for LDA topics\n\nAddresses #2229 and #2320.\n\n* fix: update help text reference files for test 273 and 274\n\nUpdate test/train-sets/ref/help.stdout and help_cbadf.stdout to match\nthe improved help strings, fixing the E2E help output diff tests.\n\n* fix: correct line wrapping in help text reference files\n\nAdjust cb_type help text wrapping to match VW's actual output format.\nThe help formatter wraps \"Multi-Task Regression,\" on one line.",
