          "id": "402acfbe22855970f2cfb1bd6e93d98ad7ce9d24",
          "message": "test: remove --quiet from tests 334-391 (#4851)\n\n* test: remove --quiet from tests 334-391 and add stderr references\n\nRemove --quiet flag from 11 E2E tests (334-336, 347-348, 354, 387-391)\nso their stderr output is validated against reference files. This\nincreases test coverage by checking the progressive validation table\nand log messages that were previously suppressed.\n\n* test: reduce datasets and remove --quiet for tests 124, 130, 131\n\n- Replace gauss1k.dat.gz (10k lines) with gauss1k_small.dat.gz (25 lines)\n  for recall_tree tests 124-125\n- Replace poisson.dat (99 lines) with poisson_small.dat (25 lines)\n  for poisson tests 130-131\n- Remove --quiet from tests 124, 130, 131 and add stderr validation\n- Update all affected reference files (stderr, predictions)",
