          "id": "d6403c031a8ac7db23cd212e96bb268f6c47669a",
          "message": "test: add 52 unit tests for coverage batch 7 (#4852)\n\n* test: add 52 unit tests for coverage batch 7 targeting 540+ uncovered lines\n\nAdd coverage_batch7_test.cc with 52 new unit tests covering 7 previously\nuncovered or under-covered source files:\n\n- shared_data.cc: copy assignment, move ctor/assignment (57% -> 98.7%)\n- debug_print.cc: all label/prediction/feature string formatters (0% -> 100%)\n- confidence_sequence.cc: update, bounds, reset, persist (0% -> 98.4%)\n- cressieread.cc: update, bounds, reset, persist (0% -> 100%)\n- parse_primitives.cc: escaped_tokenize, trim, split functions (28% -> 98.8%)\n- mf.cc: basic training, save/load round-trip (9% -> 100%)\n- no_label.cc: parse with extra tokens, default/test labels (22% -> 81.2%)\n\n* fix: avoid clang -Wself-assign-overloaded error in self-assign test\n\nUse pointer indirection (sd = *p) instead of direct self-assignment\n(sd = sd) to prevent clang from flagging the intentional self-assign\ntest as an error under -Werror.",
