          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1b0907ad04d95a9b761547eace6e67db671c05ff",
          "message": "fix: update parsed option value in options_cli::replace() (#2539) (#4857)\n\nreplace() only modified the raw _command_line string vector but left\nthe already-parsed typed_option value stale. This caused a silent\nmismatch: serialization saw the new value while runtime code reading\nvia get_typed_option<T>().value() saw the original.\n\nAdd a replace_value_visitor that uses the existing visitor pattern and\nconvert_token_value<T>() to update the parsed value atomically within\nreplace(). Remove the now-redundant manual .value() calls in search.cc.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-02T10:41:51-05:00",
          "tree_id": "be710077d9457828e8a9c46d76919488338742ec",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/1b0907ad04d95a9b761547eace6e67db671c05ff"
