          "id": "cc247e34aaabcd8b82360dc3007fae92dce14976",
          "message": "ci: add submodule init retry to all checkout steps (#4856)\n\nReplace one-shot submodule init with a 5-attempt retry loop (15s\nbackoff) after each actions/checkout step that uses submodules.\nThis addresses intermittent SSL/network failures during CI submodule\ncloning on GitHub Actions runners.\n\nEach checkout step is split into two steps:\n1. actions/checkout@v6 with submodules: false\n2. A retry loop running git submodule update --init --recursive\n\nAdds safe.directory config before submodule init to handle\ncontainer-based jobs where checkout and subsequent steps run as\ndifferent users.\n\nMove large test dependencies (scipy, scikit-learn, etc.) to\nbefore-test with pip install retry to handle transient SSL errors.\nKeep vw-executor in test-requires since it depends on vowpalwabbit\nand must install after the built wheel.\n\nApplied to 38 checkout steps across 17 workflow files.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-02T11:24:26-05:00",
          "tree_id": "a3d80d715b961d19224e1cf983395a985fa89e92",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/cc247e34aaabcd8b82360dc3007fae92dce14976"
