          "message": "ci: add ccache to cibuildwheel macOS builds (#4858)\n\nCache C++ object files across the 5 sequential Python version builds\n(3.10-3.14) within each cibuildwheel macOS job. The C++ core is\nidentical across versions — only pylibvw.cc (pybind11 binding) differs,\nso cp311+ builds see near-100% cache hit rates.\n\nInstall ccache via Homebrew, add CMAKE_C/CXX_COMPILER_LAUNCHER=ccache\nand CCACHE_* env vars. CCACHE_BASEDIR normalizes paths across build\ndirectories for cache hits.\n\nResults: macos-14 ARM 12m→9m (-23%), macos-15-intel 24m→14m (-43%).\n\nWindows excluded: CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_LAUNCHER only works with\nMakefile/Ninja generators, not Visual Studio. Ninja on Windows needs\nvcvarsall.bat which cibuildwheel can't persist across commands.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-02T20:09:09-05:00",
          "tree_id": "69f7064b7da51e6c6a803dcfeb061fd49204df22",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/7908980e19856bc50ac42915fad781afd5daeada"
