          "id": "2ba68fc2926071a2f72d43df2ac794c1a71afbf6",
          "message": "fix: add bounds checking to ECT and CSOAA_LDF reductions (#4859)\n\nAdd validation to prevent crashes when processing examples with\ninvalid or missing label data:\n\n- ECT: Check that multiclass label is in valid range [1, k] before\n  using it as an array index. Previously, label=0 caused underflow\n  when computing mc.label-1, leading to out-of-bounds access.\n\n- CSOAA_LDF: Check that costs array is non-empty before accessing\n  costs[0]. Replace assertion with graceful warning when costs.size()\n  != 1, treating such examples as test data instead of crashing.\n\nThese fixes prevent segfaults that occurred when processing flatbuffer\ndata with incompatible label formats for these reductions.\n\nFixes crashes in pyvw tests 240 and 241 (related to issue #3195).",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-04T09:52:33-05:00",
          "tree_id": "e45c3dc08393b408ae7bfb2496cc1ff9e1fdd306",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/2ba68fc2926071a2f72d43df2ac794c1a71afbf6"
