          "id": "85f57de481cd0443420ee8f36e2bdb5dee25c056",
          "message": "ci: fix invalid replace() function in lint workflow (#4863)\n\n* ci: fix invalid replace() function in lint workflow\n\nGitHub Actions expressions don't have a replace() function.\nUse pre-computed artifact_name in matrix config instead.\n\n* ci: add path to download-artifact to match expected directory\n\n* ci: use setup-python for typecheck-build to match target Python version\n\n* style: format Python files with black 26.1.0",
