          "id": "9fe1000784ccc6069d0cb7cc1e82e30ad4285904",
          "message": "docs: add Python configuration tutorial (#4862)\n\nAdd comprehensive documentation explaining how to configure VW models\nin Python, addressing issue #3082.\n\nThe tutorial covers:\n- How command-line arguments map to Python parameters\n- The three configuration methods (arg_str, arg_list, **kwargs)\n- Common configuration patterns for different use cases\n- The scikit-learn wrapper interface\n- Common pitfalls and best practices\n\nCloses #3082",
