          "id": "34c54ea16e6f4df212dc784059a11350b5ae418c",
          "message": "fix(java): comprehensive Java bindings improvements\n\n## Summary\n- Reduce test skip list from ~485 to 20 tests (716 tests now passing)\n- Add runDriver() JNI method for multi-pass multiline learners (fixes cb_adf test 342)\n- Add 4 new prediction types: NoPred, ActionPDFValue, PDF, ActiveMulticlass\n- Add isMultiline() JNI API for native learner type detection\n- Fix entity relation assert crash in search_entityrelationtask.cc\n- Fix double-save bug breaking automl pre_save_load hooks\n- Fix JNI string leak in initialize()\n- Enable CSV feature flag in CI",
