          "id": "7fe1db44888c24f6ed8a8cd1216244d1cb583f23",
          "message": "ci(java): add multi-platform publish workflow (#4866)\n\nBuild native JNI libraries on all 5 supported platforms (linux_64,\nlinux_arm64, macos_arm64, macos_x64, windows_64) and assemble them\ninto a single multi-platform JAR.\n\nTriggered by version tags or manual dispatch. The actual Maven Central\ndeploy step (GPG signing, OSSRH credentials) will be added once\nsecrets are configured.",
