          "message": "fix(ci): fix JAR content verification in java-publish workflow (#4868)\n\nThe glob vw-jni-*.jar matches main, sources, and javadoc JARs.\njar tf interprets extra filenames as entry filters, finding nothing.\nUse the specific main JAR filename instead.",
