          "distinct": true,
          "id": "77f008291ebca70f4b3dacc4f7343b991bf66db4",
          "message": "feat(java): enable JNI builds on Windows (#4869)\n\nRemove BUILD_JAVA from the Windows restriction in CMakeLists.txt that\nhas blocked Java JNI compilation on Windows since 2019. The Java JNI\ninfrastructure already supports Windows (Native.java, java/CMakeLists.txt).\n\nChanges:\n- Remove BUILD_JAVA from WIN32 guard, fix VW_GOV→VW_GCOV typo\n- Clean up java/CMakeLists.txt: remove duplicate POST_BUILD/configure_file,\n  use file(GENERATE) for cross-platform vw_cli_bin.txt generation\n- Add windows-latest to java.yml CI matrix with MSVC setup\n- Add windows_64 back to java-publish.yml build matrix",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-06T16:20:10-05:00",
          "tree_id": "773be4b21ddf0a76874a4f019f199d9e8ff9fdc4",
