          "distinct": true,
          "id": "945a63c8c92e5abc0a090e7674ec5d98d8a3f533",
          "message": "ci: add big_tests regression suite to CI (#4871)\n\n* ci: add big_tests to Standalone workflow\n\nAdd 8 regression tests from big_tests/ to the existing Standalone CI\nworkflow, reusing the Linux Release/gcc build artifact. Tests run in 2\nparallel jobs that fit within the existing Windows bottleneck (~14 min),\nadding no extra wall-clock time to the workflow.\n\n- big-tests: Covertype, URLRep, OCR (train+predict), MovieLens (train+predict)\n- big-tests-mnist: MNIST (train+predict)\n\nAlso fixes:\n- ocr2vw.py: Python 3 compatibility (gzip text mode, file write mode)\n- dataSets.mk: Update dead MNIST URL to Google Storage mirror\n\nToward #2128.\n\n* ci: merge big-tests-mnist into big-tests job\n\nCombined runtime (~10 min) is still well under the Windows bottleneck\n(~15 min), so a single job doesn't increase overall workflow time.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-07T15:18:01-05:00",
          "tree_id": "0bb8b46280cf4bae4d8588aa5c3e37a32ae7ca9f",
