          "id": "8c9ef463101c0e2c90f44a6e5a6ca1011895119f",
          "message": "ci: parallelize valgrind unit tests with integration test segments (#4873)\n\n* ci: parallelize valgrind unit tests with integration test segments\n\nMove valgrind unit tests (ctest -T memcheck) to a separate job that\nruns in parallel with the 5 integration test segment jobs, instead of\nblocking them. The build tree is uploaded as a tarball (excluding .o\nfiles) and downloaded by the unit test job.\n\nBefore: build+unit-tests (24 min) → test segments (5 min) = ~30 min\nAfter:  build (7 min) → max(unit-tests (19 min), segments (5 min)) = ~26 min\n\n* ci(valgrind): consolidate integration test segments from 5 to 2\n\nThe 5 segments (4m each) are well under the unit test bottleneck\n(19m), so 2 segments (~11m each) still finish first while reducing\njob overhead.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-07T17:32:55-05:00",
          "tree_id": "858cbafaa5881e3dbab33daa612663effdaa9d0a",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/8c9ef463101c0e2c90f44a6e5a6ca1011895119f"
