          "distinct": true,
          "id": "33d16dab0f90c7cbb0241eb516d8a2eea3a0193b",
          "message": "ci: consolidate Python wheel workflows, normalize build flags (#4872)\n\n* ci: consolidate Python wheel CI workflows into unified python_checks.yml\n\nMerge backward_model_load_check.yml, forward_model_load_check.yml,\nbuild_docs.yml, and lint.yml typecheck jobs into a single workflow.\nThis reduces Python wheel builds from 6 to 2 per CI run (~20 min saved).\n\nAlso enable VW_FEAT_FLATBUFFERS=On in build_macos.yml (flatbuffers was\ninstalled via brew but the feature flag was never enabled).\n\n* fix(ci): set C++17 standard in build_macos for flatbuffers compatibility\n\nEnabling VW_FEAT_FLATBUFFERS=On causes brew's boost/math headers to\nrequire C++14 type aliases (std::remove_cv_t, etc.) that aren't available\nin the default C++11 mode. Set VW_CXX_STANDARD=17 to match vendor_build.\n\n* revert: drop build_macos.yml flatbuffers/C++17 changes\n\nEnabling VW_FEAT_FLATBUFFERS=On requires C++17 (for boost headers),\nbut C++17 changes floating point behavior causing LDA test failures\non macOS. Revert to master state until test baselines are updated.\n\n* fix(ci): prevent codecov/project from stalling on workflow changes\n\nNo CI workflow uploads coverage data, so codecov's auto-detected\nbuild count causes it to wait indefinitely when workflows are\nadded or removed. Set after_n_builds: 0 to report immediately.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-07T19:41:06-05:00",
          "tree_id": "50f4ab61bfad667ba4f0ef467d905550e30ca290",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/33d16dab0f90c7cbb0241eb516d8a2eea3a0193b"
