          "distinct": true,
          "id": "19cc614d60c223d5ad9062a610a0d2fb200432e6",
          "message": "chore: maintenance release hardening (#4874)\n\n* ci: replace EOL Ubuntu 18.04 containers with ubuntu-latest\n\n- Remove vowpalwabbit/ubuntu1804-build container (EOL May 2023)\n- Run directly on ubuntu-latest (Ubuntu 24.04)\n- Update actions/checkout@v1 to @v6\n- Add submodule retry pattern for reliability\n- Replace deprecated codecov bash uploader with codecov-action@v5\n- Remove CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 workaround\n\n* build: update fmt 9.1.0 → 11.0.2 and spdlog 1.11.0 → 1.15.0\n\n- fmt 11.0.2: compile-time format string checking, performance improvements\n- spdlog 1.15.0: designed for fmt 11, includes security fixes\n- Remove pre-fmt-8 version guards in logger.h (12 #if blocks)\n- Update minimum version comments in ext_libs.cmake\n- Wasm build unaffected (uses vcpkg spdlog with bundled fmt)\n\n* build(java): update Maven plugins and test dependencies\n\nPlugins:\n- maven-clean-plugin 2.6.1 → 3.4.1\n- maven-compiler-plugin 3.11.0 → 3.13.0\n- maven-enforcer-plugin 1.1 → 3.5.0\n- extra-enforcer-rules 1.0-alpha-3 → 1.8.0\n- maven-failsafe-plugin 3.1.2 → 3.5.2\n- maven-surefire-plugin 3.1.2 → 3.5.2\n- maven-resources-plugin 2.7 → 3.3.1\n- maven-javadoc-plugin 3.0.1 → 3.11.2\n- maven-source-plugin 3.0.1 → 3.3.1\n- maven-gpg-plugin 1.6 → 3.2.7\n- nexus-staging-maven-plugin 1.6.5 → 1.7.0\n\nDependencies:\n- JUnit 5.10.0 → 5.11.4\n- Gson 2.10.1 → 2.11.0\n- Guava 32.1.3-jre → 33.4.0-jre\n\n* docs: add CHANGELOG.md and update CONTRIBUTING.md\n\n- Create CHANGELOG.md covering all changes since 9.10.0\n- Add development setup section with build/test commands\n- Add commit convention guide (conventional commits)\n- Update PR section to reflect current CI (~80 jobs)\n\n* fix(nuget): add /utf-8 MSVC flag for fmt 11 compatibility\n\nfmt 11 requires the /utf-8 compiler flag on MSVC for Unicode support.\nWithout it, base.h triggers C2338 static_assert.\n\n* fix(docs): correct starting coverage percentage in CHANGELOG\n\nWas ~82%, not ~88%.\n\n* docs: improve CHANGELOG and CONTRIBUTING accuracy\n\n- Update test count from ~500 to ~900 (measured against 9.10.0 tag)\n- Add Java, C#, and Python prediction/label type features to CHANGELOG\n- Add Java integration test runner and C# unskipped tests to test section\n- Mention C# builds in CONTRIBUTING.md\n\n* docs: note coverage baseline reset from gcc 7 → 13 in CHANGELOG",
