          "distinct": true,
          "id": "69a38bc0cf5c660b0afb102402d4fa01ea6e4603",
          "message": "chore: maintenance release hardening for 9.11.0 (#4880)\n\n* chore: address substantial TODO items across reductions\n\n- Deduplicate binary_search(): extract identical implementations from\n  cs_active.cc, cb_explore_adf_regcb.cc, and cb_explore_adf_squarecb.cc\n  into shared header confidence_sequence_utility.h\n- scorer.cc: thread step parameter through multipredict instead of\n  hardcoding 0, fixing weight vector offset for multi-model predictions\n- nn.cc: guard hidden bias constant feature setup with add_constant\n  check so --noconstant flag is respected\n- parser.cc: replace deprecated POSIX daemon() with fork()+setsid()\n- memory_tree.cc: replace all std::cout with trace_message guarded by\n  --quiet, fixing output suppression\n\n* style: fix clang-format issues\n\n- Indent preprocessor directives inside blocks with #  prefix\n- Sort includes alphabetically (setup_base.h)\n- Fix operator<< line break alignment for trace_message\n- Collapse short if-body to single line\n\n* style: fix remaining clang-format alignment in memory_tree.cc\n\n* chore: version bump to 9.11.0 with model compat, code cleanup, and CI hardening\n\n- Bump version to 9.11.0 for release preparation\n- Add backward-compatible model loading for memory_tree (version gate at 9.11.0)\n- Remove unused DEPRECATED_WRITEIT/DEPRECATED_WRITEITVAR macros from io_buf.h\n- Consolidate duplicated get_cost_ranges() from regcb/squarecb into\n  confidence_sequence_utility\n- Migrate audit output (gd, gd_mf) and debug output (stagewise_poly,\n  log_multi) from std::cout to trace_message\n- Remove commented-out std::cout lines from active.cc and kernel_svm.cc\n- Cache FetchContent downloads in CI to avoid googletest 502 failures\n- Update test reference files for version bump and audit output migration\n\n* ci: trigger workflow runs\n\n* style: fix clang-format issues after rebase\n\n* fix: restore reference files and fix model version gate\n\nRevert reference files for tests 146/148/349/409/413/436 to master\nversions (only keeping version string updates). Fix model version\ngate from {9,11,0} to {9,10,0} since master already writes the new\nmodel_utils format at version 9.10.0.\n\n* fix: route gd_mf audit output to stdout via audit_writer, matching gd.cc\n\ngd_mf was writing audit output to trace_message (stderr), unlike gd.cc\nwhich uses audit_writer (stdout). This mixed audit data with diagnostics\non stderr, making --quiet unusable for clean audit output. Switch to\naudit_writer and add --quiet to test 525.\n\n* fix: route LDA audit output to stdout via audit_writer, remove --quiet from gd_mf test\n\nprint_lda_features in gd.cc was writing audit output to trace_message\n(stderr) instead of audit_writer (stdout), same issue as gd_mf. Also\nremove unnecessary --quiet from gd_mf audit test since audit now goes\nto stdout cleanly separated from diagnostics on stderr.\n\n* fix: restore gd_mf_audit.stderr reference with diagnostics-only content\n\n* style: fix clang-format issues in gd_mf.cc",
