          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c26ac262f2f6b35607e0571d1764d4a4ad817819",
          "message": "chore: clean up stale TODOs and fix real issues in CB/ADF and JSON parser (#4881)\n\nCB/ADF changes:\n- Remove 6 stale TODOs (cb_adf.cc, cb_explore.cc, cb_dro.cc, warm_cb.cc,\n  cb_algs.h, baseline_challenger_cb.cc) with clarifying comments where useful\n- Replace 2 cbify.cc FIXMEs with explanatory comments (label is correctly\n  restored before print_update runs)\n- Delete dead CB_ALGS namespace (zero internal callers, deprecated wrappers\n  forwarding to VW:: equivalents); update 2 C# callers to use VW:: directly\n- Update cb.cc feature-counting duplication comment with current locations\n\nJSON parser fixes:\n- Fix label type dispatch in LabelState::Float/Uint — was unconditionally\n  writing to l.simple.label regardless of label type; now dispatches to\n  l.multi.label for MULTICLASS and errors for unsupported types\n- Add guard against nested _multi keys (would corrupt multi-example structure)\n- Implement missing Slates pdrop weight adjustment (was a bare // TODO)\n- Remove 2 low-value \"improve validation\" TODOs in DecisionServiceState",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-17T20:22:15-05:00",
          "tree_id": "c7a848ab5775a9a19d6084780feacb9c071ffcc7",
