          "distinct": true,
          "id": "93095abad3e3bc64174ead781e3441ed9bfad076",
          "message": "fix: remove prediction cache hack in cb_explore_adf_bag (#4882)\n\nThe bag reduction's learn() iterates over sub-learners, each of which\noverwrites examples[0]->pred.a_s. Previously, the prediction from\npredict() was cached in _action_probs, and three custom callback\nfunctions (update_stats_bag, print_update_bag, output_example_prediction_bag)\nrestored it from the cache before delegating to the base class.\n\nThis was fragile (\"awful hack\") and required modifying examples through\na const reference, which was a design concern noted in TODOs.\n\nFix: save/restore examples[0]->pred.a_s directly in learn(), eliminating\nthe need for the cache and custom callbacks. The default cb_explore_adf_base\ncallbacks now work correctly for bag.\n\nAlso remove unused _saved_pred member from cb_explore_adf_common.h.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-17T20:51:22-05:00",
          "tree_id": "1d8fcb083ca7c5faf8d0f545c840a1190e19db7a",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/93095abad3e3bc64174ead781e3441ed9bfad076"
