          "id": "1a46ea94d404e980889f253e569c3d44f7e63e2c",
          "message": "chore: remove stale TODOs in parse_regressor, recall_tree, and others (#4884)\n\n* chore: remove stale TODOs in parse_regressor, recall_tree, and others\n\n- parse_regressor.cc: remove 6 stale TODOs (legacy format validation that\n  will never be implemented, uncertain duplication comment, dead code\n  referencing removed API)\n- recall_tree.cc: replace 3 speculative TODOs with clarifying comment about\n  NODE_ID_NAMESPACE being reserved and add/remove always being paired\n- interaction_ground.cc: remove vague \"_metrics?\" TODO\n- cs_active.cc: remove stale TODO(alberto) for absolute loss (now available\n  via --cs_absolute_loss in csoaa/csoaa_ldf)\n- learner.cc: remove misleading comments about deep copy bug in\n  multipredict (std::move is the correct solution)\n\n* style: fix clang-format in learner.cc",
