          "id": "ea35097b3562813b55b567f1d782493f433cccd7",
          "message": "chore: fix gzopen error handling, remove stale TODOs, delete dead code (#4885)\n\n* chore: fix gzopen error handling, remove stale TODOs, delete dead code\n\n- Fix bug: add missing error check after gzopen() in gzip_file_adapter\n  (matches file_adapter pattern)\n- Delete unused VW::details::print_update() function and declaration\n- Convert 8 stale TODOs to clarifying NOTEs across SIMD, flatbuffer,\n  cache parser, sparse parameters, text parser, and LDA modules\n\n* fix: restore print_update used by output_and_account_example\n\nThe function is called at simple_label.cc:42 inside\noutput_and_account_example, which is used by return_simple_example\nand a coverage test. Replace the stale TODO with a clarifying comment.\n\n* style: clarify cache parser size field comment\n\nThe uint64_t size is consumed from the stream but discarded;\nmake that clear rather than implying a variable exists.\n\n* fix: warn on gzopen failure instead of throwing\n\nLog to stderr and leave _gz_file null (read/write already return 0\nfor null handles) rather than throwing from the low-level io layer.",
