          "distinct": true,
          "id": "50ed47e796f5167a24116a6c784e60d5d9c03158",
          "message": "build: upgrade Eigen 3.4.0 to 5.0.1, bump C++ minimum to C++14 (#4888)\n\n* build: upgrade Eigen from 3.4.0 to 5.0.1, bump C++ minimum to C++14\n\nEigen 5.0 requires C++14, so the default VW_CXX_STANDARD is raised\nfrom 11 to 14. This is a no-op for Java/Python bindings (already C++17)\nand for CI (GCC 13+ defaults to C++17).\n\nEigen 5.0 brings 4 years of performance improvements, bug fixes, and\nlicense simplification (all LGPL code removed). The two VW-relevant\nbreaking changes (JacobiSVD deprecation and CMake integration) were\nalready addressed in PRs #4728 and #4731.\n\n* fix: qualify deprecated global aliases in C# native wrappers\n\nReplace unqualified `example`, `trace_message_t`, and `prediction_type_t`\nwith `VW::example`, `VW::trace_message_t`, and `VW::prediction_type_t`\nacross C# CLI and .NET native wrapper code. These deprecated global\naliases now trigger -Werror under C++14.\n\n* fix: revert unnecessary cs/cli changes, fix formatting\n\nThe cs/cli/ files are inside namespace VW{} where unqualified example\nresolves to VW::example directly - no deprecation. Revert those changes\nto avoid clang-format issues with C++/CLI syntax. Fix line wrapping in\nvw.net.labels.cc to satisfy clang-format-14.\n\n* fix: resolve remaining deprecated symbol warnings in .NET native code\n\n- vw.net.builders.h: features* -> VW::features*\n- vw.net.example.cc: GD::trunc_weight -> VW::trunc_weight\n- vw.net.example.cc: suppress deprecation warning for is_ring_example\n  (function itself is deprecated, but wrapper API needs to call it)\n\n* fix: resolve SpanningTree and workspace deprecated symbol warnings\n\n- SpanningTree -> spanning_tree, methods to snake_case\n- Suppress deprecation warnings for VW::initialize, VW::seed_vw_model,\n  and VW::finish (migrating to new unique_ptr API is out of scope)\n\n* fix: extend deprecation warning suppression to entire workspace.cc\n\nWorkspaceReload also calls deprecated VW::finish and VW::initialize.\nMove the warning suppression to wrap the entire file.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-19T20:11:59-05:00",
          "tree_id": "42306150eb4e2919a309e4acc9ef790711260bc5",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/50ed47e796f5167a24116a6c784e60d5d9c03158"
