          "message": "fix: add osx-arm64 runtime dependency to combined .NET nuget package (#4894)\n\n* docs: update CHANGELOG for Eigen 5.0.1 upgrade and C++14 minimum\n\n* fix: add osx-arm64 runtime dependency to combined .NET nuget package\n\nThe combined VowpalWabbit NuGet package (dotnet.nuspec.in) was missing\nthe osx-arm64 runtime dependency, so Apple Silicon users of this package\nwould not pull in the native library. The .NET Core-only package\n(dotnetcore.nuspec.in) already had this dependency.\n\nCloses #4893",
