          "message": "docs: update CHANGELOG with #4891, #4892, #4894 (#4895)\n\n* docs: update CHANGELOG with #4891, #4892, #4894\n\n* docs: add 9.11.0 release summary to CHANGELOG\n\n* ci: add retry logic to vcpkg bootstrap step\n\nReplace the lukka/run-vcpkg action with an inline shell step that\nretries bootstrap up to 3 times, matching the existing retry pattern\nused for submodule init and CMake configure.",
