          "id": "ebd2d4f62d394519e8dc3f0ca22f6beb25b54335",
          "message": "fix(ci): install flatbuffers for static JNI build, fix nuget version race (#4896)\n\n- java-publish.yml: install flatbuffers-compiler and libflatbuffers-dev\n  for the static-jni-test job which enables VW_FEAT_FLATBUFFERS\n- native_nugets.yml: pass version as job output from build to test job\n  instead of recomputing via version_number.py, which can produce a\n  different result if a tag is pushed between the two jobs",
