          "id": "78b8ca3b09ce87a3ca7b80d7768c2545c1b09293",
          "message": "fix(ci): move CCACHE_DIR from job-level env to step-level (#4899)\n\nrunner.temp is not available in job-level env: blocks (the runner\ncontext is only available after a runner is assigned). This caused\nthe entire ASAN workflow to fail with 0 jobs since #4877 (Feb 9).\n\nMove CCACHE_DIR to GITHUB_ENV in the ccache configure step so it's\navailable to all subsequent steps, with a step-level env for the\nconfigure step itself.",
