          "id": "01279f223f4425ec7e416aa2405fe5f8a8c32ebc",
          "message": "fix(cmake): handle RapidJSON package without target (#4902)\n\nWhen RAPIDJSON_SYS_DEP=ON, some package managers provide include variables but no imported RapidJSON CMake target. Create a local interface target in that case and keep using the same include variables.\n\nRefs: Homebrew/homebrew-core#270066\n\nSigned-off-by: Rui Chen <rui@chenrui.dev>\nCo-authored-by: John <jl@hunch.net>",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-02T12:10:43-05:00",
