          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6d8e6e6f6c97acb106848ea89a1c2e517885caf3",
          "message": "fix: reset flatbuffer parser state on error to prevent use-after-free (#4905)\n\nWhen run_bad_namespace_test runs 4 sub-tests in sequence (Example,\nMultiExample, ExampleCollection singleline, ExampleCollection multiline),\nthey share the same flat_converter parser instance. If the MultiExample\nsub-test fails with a parse error, _active_multi_ex remains true and\n_multi_example_object still points into the now-freed flatbuffer.\n\nOn the next sub-test, if the heap allocator reuses the same address for\nthe new aligned_buffer, the buffer_pointer == _flatbuffer_pointer check\nin parse_examples skips the state reset, causing parse_multi_example to\ndereference _multi_example_object into freed memory (SEH 0xc0000005).\n\nFix: reset parser state on the error path in read_span_flatbuffer via a\nnew public reset_state() method.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-02T14:24:22-05:00",
          "tree_id": "95d6c75b42f490ed5cbd578a0b9d8a549c0e6a4b",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/6d8e6e6f6c97acb106848ea89a1c2e517885caf3"
