          "distinct": true,
          "id": "998e390e80a7e8192d7849b7784bc113dbd190ad",
          "message": "Merge commit from fork\n\nThe four steps in python_checks.yml that pass the PR title to\nrun_tests_model_gen_and_load.py interpolated ${{ github.event.pull_request.title }}\ndirectly into a double-quoted bash string, allowing a crafted PR title to\nbreak out of the quotes and execute arbitrary shell on the runner.\n\nBind the title to a PR_TITLE env var per step and reference it as \"$PR_TITLE\"\nso bash treats the value as data rather than source.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-04T21:44:22-04:00",
          "tree_id": "631b3e587ea6afc3335f91e79cf65a3cf65af8b8",
