          "distinct": true,
          "id": "adc27e8339a38a3dfc73efd54d14e51255503212",
          "message": "test: give each search test its own cache file (#4937)\n\nThe search tests pass \"-k -c\" with \"--passes 2\" and no --cache_file. With\nno data file the default cache path is data_filename + \".cache\", i.e. just\n\"./.cache\" (parse_args.cc:457), so all 13 of these tests share one path in\nthe shared working directory. -k means parse_cache always takes the\nmake_write_cache branch, so concurrent tests write over each other and the\nloser fails its second pass with\n\n    need a cache file for multiple passes : try using --cache or --cache_file <name>\n\nSeen on #4933, where core-cli.windows-latest.msvc.standalone failed on\nSearch.RolloutNone and Search.RollinLearn under `ctest --parallel 2`, while\ntheir neighbours Search.RolloutLearn and Search.RollinPolicy passed --\nthe interleaving of concurrent pairs. Re-running the identical commit\npassed, which is what identified it as a race rather than a regression.\n\nReplace \"-c\" with an explicit per-test --cache_file. It has to replace it\nrather than accompany it: -c appends the shared default path to cache_files\nunconditionally, so keeping both would preserve the collision.\n\nThe cache is written to <name>.writing and only renamed to <name> when the\nwrite is finalized, which these tests never reach, so cleanup removes both\nand the tests no longer leave droppings in the working directory.\n\nVerified: the mechanism is demonstrable directly -- running three of these\ntests from one binary creates a single \".cache.writing\" before this change\nand three distinct per-test files after it, and the working directory is\nleft empty. Full suite 2431/2431 passes.\n\nNot verified: the collision itself never reproduced locally on Linux over\n80 forced-contention runs. The failure was observed on Windows, whose file\nlocking widens the window considerably, so the fix rests on the mechanism\nand on removing the shared path rather than on a local repro.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-18T07:55:58-04:00",
          "tree_id": "0be0d18ebd23c14227f7f7b44454c08ad05a11cd",
          "url": "https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/commit/adc27e8339a38a3dfc73efd54d14e51255503212"
